JSON conversion: to-yaml / to-toml / minify / prettify

Usage: ubertool json [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  to-yaml   Convert JSON to YAML
  to-toml   Convert JSON to TOML
  minify    Minify JSON (strip whitespace)
  prettify  Prettify JSON with indentation
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json     Output as JSON to stdout. Human messages still go to stderr
  -q, --quiet    Bare values only (pipe-friendly)
  -v, --verbose  Verbose progress to stderr
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
